.DS_Store
*.bak.*
/omacosy-bar.app/
/omacosy-gesture.app/
/omacosy-ffm.app/
config/apps.local.conf
config/aerospace/aerospace.toml
# OmniWM writes into its live config directory as it runs: settings.toml.pre-v<N>
# on each schema migration (0.8.0 wrote pre-v5), shell/ since 0.8.0, and whatever
# it adds next. On a symlink install those writes land in the clone, because
# config/omniwm links to ~/.config/omniwm. A copy install keeps them in
# ~/.config/omniwm instead. Ignore the directory and allow-list only the file
# this repo ships, so a new OmniWM release cannot dirty the tree.
#
# Ignored files are expendable: a pull may replace them with no warning, and the
# omacosy-update note about untracked files no longer covers them. When #43 ships
# a settings template, add it to the allow-list below.
config/omniwm/*
!config/omniwm/settings.toml
